  "gold_independence_rationale": "Gate uses gfit SPREAD across rivals only (never which rival is gold-correct). Stage-2 held-out gold is independent who-did-what annotation (_meta.independence). gfit model built on MINING corpus only; third reader (gold source) EXCLUDED. No ground-by-X-grade-by-X.",
